## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a scalable, compliant telemetry pipeline with region isolation and real-time processing. It probes data modeling, idempotent semantics, and resilience at scale.

## Key Concepts
- Regional Pub/Sub and Dataflow streaming
- Schema validation and deduplication
- Tenant isolation via separate datasets and buckets
- Data residency and cross-region backups
- Observability and failover strategies

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo Dataflow transform sketch
function process(event) {
  if (!validateSchema(event)) throw new Error('Invalid');
  if (isDuplicate(event)) return;
  if (isAnomalous(event)) emit('anomaly', event);
  emitAggregates(event);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you allocate costs per tenant?
- How would you test end-to-end failover in a CI pipeline?

## Why This Is Asked
